Bharat Small Modular Reactor (BSMR) is being jointly designed and developed by Bhabha Atomic Research Centre (BARC) a constituent unit of DAE and Nuclear Power Corporation of India Limited (NPCIL) a PSU under DAE. Estimated time for construction of BSMR is 60 to 72 months from receipt of administrative & financial approval.

